Package: vaevictis-archive-keyring
Version: 2026.10.18
Architecture: all
Maintainer: linuxtuts-website <292920559+linuxtuts-website@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://vaevictisos.org
Description: removes the VaeVictis APT repository, which is closed
 The VaeVictis APT repository (apt.linuxtuts.online) was closed in October
 2026. This last version of the package removes what the earlier versions
 installed: the repository's key, its source entry and its apt pin, so apt
 no longer contacts it. Updates keep coming from Debian.
 .
 After that this package is empty and can be removed:
 sudo apt purge vaevictis-archive-keyring
